<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-2</name><desc>MTB-2 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, some of them handy links between hiking routes. It's 19.0 km from near Velestovo to Dva Javora, with about 652 m of climbing and 189 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 1,024 m and 1,555 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-2/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="41.087773" lon="20.828056"><name>MTB-2 start</name><desc>near Velestovo</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="40.987401" lon="20.867941"><name>MTB-2 end</name><desc>Dva Javora</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.027216" lon="20.865554"><name>Asan Djura</name><desc>Park guidepost. </desc><sym>Flag</sym></wpt>
